File Index: 69 of 109
Audio ID: 7353177528640589056
Audio Duration: 7m 10.5s (430.50s)
Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-11-10 11:20:35 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 1.00)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,680] | Elapsed:  14.24s | Words: 6  | Text: 你知道你为什么没钱吗
Segment #2   [00:00:01,680 --> 00:00:02,960] | Elapsed:  14.24s | Words: 8  | Text: 这个视频我给你答案
Segment #3   [00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:03,760] | Elapsed:  14.24s | Words: 3  | Text: 我们都知道
Segment #4   [00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:06,360] | Elapsed:  14.24s | Words: 12 | Text: 现在创造公司经济形势不太好
Segment #5   [00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:08,400] | Elapsed:  14.24s | Words: 11 | Text: 创造公司导致率接近90%
Segment #6   [00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:10,440] | Elapsed:  14.24s | Words: 9  | Text: 很多人也都面临着事业
Segment #7   [00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:12,840] | Elapsed:  14.24s | Words: 11 | Text: 实体能受打击也陆续凋零
Segment #8   [00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:15,060] | Elapsed:  14.24s | Words: 15 | Text: 普通人兜里的钱好像变得越来越少了
Segment #9   [00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:16,440] | Elapsed:  14.24s | Words: 7  | Text: 但是有一个点你可能不知道
Segment #10  [00:00:16,860 --> 00:00:18,360] | Elapsed:  14.24s | Words: 9  | Text: 根据福福斯数据显示
Segment #11  [00:00:18,360 --> 00:00:20,200] | Elapsed:  14.24s | Words: 9  | Text: 美国1万富翁的财富
Segment #12  [00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:23,940] | Elapsed:  14.24s | Words: 14 | Text: 从2023年1月份到2024年1月份
Segment #13  [00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:26,780] | Elapsed:  14.24s | Words: 8  | Text: 这一年增长了47%
Segment #14  [00:00:26,780 --> 00:00:29,020] | Elapsed:  14.24s | Words: 9  | Text: 而2021年到2024年期间
Segment #15  [00:00:29,020 --> 00:00:32,440] | Elapsed:  31.01s | Words: 11 | Text: 全球输入最高的1%的人口
Segment #16  [00:00:32,440 --> 00:00:33,560] | Elapsed:  31.01s | Words: 6  | Text: 他们的心中财富
Segment #17  [00:00:33,940 --> 00:00:35,980] | Elapsed:  31.01s | Words: 8  | Text: 几乎是其他的99%的人
Segment #18  [00:00:36,380 --> 00:00:38,040] | Elapsed:  31.01s | Words: 9  | Text: 人口财富增长了两倍
Segment #19  [00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:39,060] | Elapsed:  31.01s | Words: 3  | Text: 说白了
Segment #20  [00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:41,180] | Elapsed:  31.01s | Words: 9  | Text: 这是今天我们要探讨的主题
Segment #21  [00:00:41,180 --> 00:00:41,860] | Elapsed:  31.01s | Words: 4  | Text: 马太效应
Segment #22  [00:00:41,860 --> 00:00:43,140] | Elapsed:  31.01s | Words: 6  | Text: 穷人越来越穷
Segment #23  [00:00:43,140 --> 00:00:44,060] | Elapsed:  31.01s | Words: 6  | Text: 富人越来越富
Segment #24  [00:00:44,620 --> 00:00:46,340] | Elapsed:  31.01s | Words: 12 | Text: 马太效应最早是有社会学家
Segment #25  [00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:48,140] | Elapsed:  31.01s | Words: 10 | Text: 罗伯特莫顿他先提出来的
Segment #26  [00:00:48,140 --> 00:00:49,640] | Elapsed:  31.01s | Words: 10 | Text: 到后来越来越多的人发现
Segment #27  [00:00:49,640 --> 00:00:52,120] | Elapsed:  31.01s | Words: 11 | Text: 这不仅仅是一个经济学规律
Segment #28  [00:00:52,120 --> 00:00:54,120] | Elapsed:  31.01s | Words: 10 | Text: 在社会心理学教育行业
Segment #29  [00:00:54,120 --> 00:00:54,600] | Elapsed:  31.01s | Words: 2  | Text: 商业
Segment #30  [00:00:54,600 --> 00:00:56,240] | Elapsed:  31.01s | Words: 10 | Text: 几乎各个方面都能说得通
Segment #31  [00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:57,320] | Elapsed:  48.87s | Words: 4  | Text: 就比方说
Segment #32  [00:00:58,800 --> 00:01:00,060] | Elapsed:  48.87s | Words: 7  | Text: 一些搞垄断的企业
Segment #33  [00:01:00,060 --> 00:01:01,800] | Elapsed:  48.87s | Words: 9  | Text: 现在比方说这个直播带货
Segment #34  [00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:03,100] | Elapsed:  48.87s | Words: 7  | Text: 那网红流量越大
Segment #35  [00:01:03,100 --> 00:01:04,480] | Elapsed:  48.87s | Words: 9  | Text: 厂家给它的批发价越低
Segment #36  [00:01:04,480 --> 00:01:05,600] | Elapsed:  48.87s | Words: 6  | Text: 做传统渠道的人
Segment #37  [00:01:05,600 --> 00:01:06,940] | Elapsed:  48.87s | Words: 7  | Text: 他就没有一点点机会
Segment #38  [00:01:06,940 --> 00:01:08,020] | Elapsed:  48.87s | Words: 7  | Text: 哪怕你也做直播
Segment #39  [00:01:08,020 --> 00:01:09,000] | Elapsed:  48.87s | Words: 6  | Text: 你直播100个人
Segment #40  [00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:09,880] | Elapsed:  48.87s | Words: 6  | Text: 我直播10万人
Segment #41  [00:01:09,880 --> 00:01:11,580] | Elapsed:  48.87s | Words: 12 | Text: 那你肯定拿不到比我低的价格
Segment #42  [00:01:11,580 --> 00:01:13,300] | Elapsed:  48.87s | Words: 9  | Text: 那学校里的孩子也是一样
Segment #43  [00:01:13,300 --> 00:01:14,440] | Elapsed:  48.87s | Words: 4  | Text: 学习好的孩子
Segment #44  [00:01:14,940 --> 00:01:16,100] | Elapsed:  48.87s | Words: 8  | Text: 他会学习越来越好
Segment #45  [00:01:16,820 --> 00:01:19,020] | Elapsed:  48.87s | Words: 9  | Text: 他会被老师终点关注
Segment #46  [00:01:19,660 --> 00:01:20,960] | Elapsed:  48.87s | Words: 8  | Text: 那在爱情里也是一样
Segment #47  [00:01:20,960 --> 00:01:22,720] | Elapsed:  48.87s | Words: 10 | Text: 那处于情感薄薇之中的人
Segment #48  [00:01:22,720 --> 00:01:23,900] | Elapsed:  48.87s | Words: 8  | Text: 他们就会越来越放松
Segment #49  [00:01:23,900 --> 00:01:26,580] | Elapsed:  65.62s | Words: 10 | Text: 他们吸引到的人会越来越多
Segment #50  [00:01:26,580 --> 00:01:27,820] | Elapsed:  65.62s | Words: 8  | Text: 吸引能力也会变强
Segment #51  [00:01:28,380 --> 00:01:29,660] | Elapsed:  65.62s | Words: 5  | Text: 从而这个叫什么
Segment #52  [00:01:30,020 --> 00:01:31,780] | Elapsed:  65.62s | Words: 8  | Text: 赢家通吃 结成固化
Segment #53  [00:01:31,780 --> 00:01:33,120] | Elapsed:  65.62s | Words: 5  | Text: 这些都是有买
Segment #54  [00:01:33,120 --> 00:01:34,520] | Elapsed:  65.63s | Words: 8  | Text: 马太效应演生出来的
Segment #55  [00:01:34,520 --> 00:01:35,980] | Elapsed:  65.63s | Words: 6  | Text: 终结出来的结论
Segment #56  [00:01:36,900 --> 00:01:38,500] | Elapsed:  65.63s | Words: 6  | Text: 关于马太效应
Segment #57  [00:01:38,500 --> 00:01:39,560] | Elapsed:  65.63s | Words: 5  | Text: 不知道你没有看过
Segment #58  [00:01:39,560 --> 00:01:41,600] | Elapsed:  65.63s | Words: 14 | Text: 《西红石属负》的演过的一个电影
Segment #59  [00:01:41,600 --> 00:01:42,280] | Elapsed:  65.63s | Words: 4  | Text: 还有一个桥段
Segment #60  [00:01:42,900 --> 00:01:44,760] | Elapsed:  65.63s | Words: 8  | Text: 这是很简单的一个例子
Segment #61  [00:01:44,760 --> 00:01:47,460] | Elapsed:  65.63s | Words: 13 | Text: 一个继承了百亿身家的普通草根
Segment #62  [00:01:47,460 --> 00:01:50,200] | Elapsed:  65.63s | Words: 14 | Text: 明明是想拼了命的把钱我去花掉
Segment #63  [00:01:50,560 --> 00:01:52,820] | Elapsed:  65.63s | Words: 13 | Text: 结果到最后发现这个钱越花越多
Segment #64  [00:01:52,820 --> 00:01:54,260] | Elapsed:  84.84s | Words: 9  | Text: 所有败家的行为到最后
Segment #65  [00:01:54,260 --> 00:01:55,640] | Elapsed:  84.84s | Words: 8  | Text: 都变成了价值投资
Segment #66  [00:01:56,060 --> 00:01:57,380] | Elapsed:  84.84s | Words: 7  | Text: 电影可能有点夸张
Segment #67  [00:01:57,380 --> 00:01:59,000] | Elapsed:  84.84s | Words: 11 | Text: 但是他讲的东西确实没毛病
Segment #68  [00:01:59,400 --> 00:02:01,580] | Elapsed:  84.84s | Words: 13 | Text: 妇人手里的钱就会像病毒一样
Segment #69  [00:02:01,580 --> 00:02:02,600] | Elapsed:  84.84s | Words: 6  | Text: 快速的去翻演
Segment #70  [00:02:02,600 --> 00:02:03,680] | Elapsed:  84.84s | Words: 7  | Text: 哪怕他什么都不做
Segment #71  [00:02:03,680 --> 00:02:05,060] | Elapsed:  84.84s | Words: 7  | Text: 那穷人手里的钱
Segment #72  [00:02:05,060 --> 00:02:07,080] | Elapsed:  84.84s | Words: 10 | Text: 他就像握不住的沙一样
Segment #73  [00:02:07,080 --> 00:02:08,760] | Elapsed:  84.84s | Words: 8  | Text: 钻得越紧 跑得越快
Segment #74  [00:02:09,460 --> 00:02:10,620] | Elapsed:  84.84s | Words: 7  | Text: 可能有很多人会疑惑
Segment #75  [00:02:10,620 --> 00:02:12,900] | Elapsed:  84.84s | Words: 9  | Text: 会说 为什么会有马太效应
Segment #76  [00:02:12,900 --> 00:02:14,040] | Elapsed:  84.84s | Words: 5  | Text: 这是什么导致的
Segment #77  [00:02:14,040 --> 00:02:15,760] | Elapsed:  84.84s | Words: 10 | Text: 为什么会导致这种贫妇杀绪
Segment #78  [00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:17,040] | Elapsed:  84.84s | Words: 4  | Text: 终结起来
Segment #79  [00:02:17,040 --> 00:02:18,880] | Elapsed:  84.84s | Words: 9  | Text: 我感觉大类有三个原因
Segment #80  [00:02:18,880 --> 00:02:20,760] | Elapsed:  84.84s | Words: 12 | Text: 这个视频绝对值得你们点来收藏
Segment #81  [00:02:21,200 --> 00:02:21,980] | Elapsed: 101.54s | Words: 4  | Text: 这三种原因
Segment #82  [00:02:21,980 --> 00:02:23,840] | Elapsed: 101.54s | Words: 13 | Text: 他也伴随了我们人生中不同的阶段
Segment #83  [00:02:24,720 --> 00:02:25,980] | Elapsed: 101.54s | Words: 6  | Text: 首先就是原始积累
Segment #84  [00:02:25,980 --> 00:02:27,240] | Elapsed: 101.54s | Words: 8  | Text: 那原生家庭有多重要
Segment #85  [00:02:27,240 --> 00:02:28,180] | Elapsed: 101.54s | Words: 5  | Text: 不用我多说了吧
Segment #86  [00:02:28,820 --> 00:02:30,140] | Elapsed: 101.54s | Words: 5  | Text: 其实人生早期
Segment #87  [00:02:30,140 --> 00:02:31,300] | Elapsed: 101.54s | Words: 4  | Text: 起跑线上
Segment #88  [00:02:32,460 --> 00:02:33,820] | Elapsed: 101.54s | Words: 6  | Text: 一点点的小偏差
Segment #89  [00:02:33,820 --> 00:02:36,140] | Elapsed: 101.54s | Words: 11 | Text: 走到最后有可能都是天上之比
Segment #90  [00:02:36,140 --> 00:02:37,160] | Elapsed: 101.54s | Words: 4  | Text: 那更何况
Segment #91  [00:02:37,160 --> 00:02:38,820] | Elapsed: 101.54s | Words: 8  | Text: 那普通人的起跑线
Segment #92  [00:02:38,820 --> 00:02:39,720] | Elapsed: 101.54s | Words: 5  | Text: 咱跟富二代
Segment #93  [00:02:39,720 --> 00:02:41,340] | Elapsed: 101.54s | Words: 5  | Text: 跟富二代比
Segment #94  [00:02:41,340 --> 00:02:42,760] | Elapsed: 101.54s | Words: 8  | Text: 他也不是差一行半点
Segment #95  [00:02:43,340 --> 00:02:44,300] | Elapsed: 101.54s | Words: 5  | Text: 富人家的孩子
Segment #96  [00:02:44,300 --> 00:02:45,540] | Elapsed: 101.54s | Words: 7  | Text: 不管这一生怎么度过
Segment #97  [00:02:45,540 --> 00:02:47,420] | Elapsed: 101.54s | Words: 6  | Text: 那最后都是富人
Segment #98  [00:02:47,420 --> 00:02:49,240] | Elapsed: 101.54s | Words: 9  | Text: 而穷人家的孩子一辈子
Segment #99  [00:02:49,240 --> 00:02:50,460] | Elapsed: 101.54s | Words: 6  | Text: 都在为辛苦奔波
Segment #100 [00:02:50,460 --> 00:02:52,020] | Elapsed: 119.98s | Words: 6  | Text: 生活也毫无起色
Segment #101 [00:02:52,460 --> 00:02:54,440] | Elapsed: 119.98s | Words: 6  | Text: 然后就是稀缺心态
Segment #102 [00:02:54,440 --> 00:02:56,160] | Elapsed: 119.98s | Words: 11 | Text: 就是每个人都会有这种心态
Segment #103 [00:02:56,160 --> 00:02:57,540] | Elapsed: 119.98s | Words: 4  | Text: 稀缺心态
Segment #104 [00:02:57,540 --> 00:02:58,960] | Elapsed: 119.98s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是越什么都没有
Segment #105 [00:02:58,960 --> 00:03:00,180] | Elapsed: 119.98s | Words: 6  | Text: 我越什么都在乎
Segment #106 [00:03:00,180 --> 00:03:01,520] | Elapsed: 119.98s | Words: 7  | Text: 那对于富人来说
Segment #107 [00:03:01,520 --> 00:03:02,600] | Elapsed: 119.98s | Words: 6  | Text: 我的钱已经够用了
Segment #108 [00:03:02,600 --> 00:03:04,420] | Elapsed: 119.98s | Words: 9  | Text: 所以我要想办法去节约时间
Segment #109 [00:03:04,420 --> 00:03:05,960] | Elapsed: 119.98s | Words: 7  | Text: 把所有的精力去干
Segment #110 [00:03:05,960 --> 00:03:09,560] | Elapsed: 119.98s | Words: 10 | Text: 自己认为比较重要的事也好
Segment #111 [00:03:09,560 --> 00:03:10,600] | Elapsed: 119.98s | Words: 8  | Text: 或者说把有限的精力
Segment #112 [00:03:10,600 --> 00:03:12,120] | Elapsed: 119.98s | Words: 7  | Text: 对待值得的人也好
Segment #113 [00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:13,140] | Elapsed: 119.98s | Words: 6  | Text: 而穷人缺的是什么
Segment #114 [00:03:13,460 --> 00:03:15,580] | Elapsed: 119.98s | Words: 11 | Text: 我可能我去买个打折的鸡蛋
Segment #115 [00:03:15,580 --> 00:03:16,180] | Elapsed: 119.98s | Words: 4  | Text: 早上起来
Segment #116 [00:03:16,180 --> 00:03:17,440] | Elapsed: 119.98s | Words: 10 | Text: 我再多半个小时公交车
Segment #117 [00:03:17,440 --> 00:03:19,020] | Elapsed: 119.98s | Words: 7  | Text: 我要在超市开门之前
Segment #118 [00:03:19,020 --> 00:03:19,700] | Elapsed: 119.98s | Words: 5  | Text: 我去偏上队
Segment #119 [00:03:19,700 --> 00:03:21,320] | Elapsed: 138.16s | Words: 6  | Text: 他没有时间去思考
Segment #120 [00:03:21,320 --> 00:03:22,320] | Elapsed: 138.16s | Words: 6  | Text: 自己的时间运多之前
Segment #121 [00:03:22,860 --> 00:03:23,920] | Elapsed: 138.16s | Words: 4  | Text: 因为这些时间
Segment #122 [00:03:23,920 --> 00:03:25,620] | Elapsed: 138.16s | Words: 8  | Text: 对他们来说毫无意义
Segment #123 [00:03:25,620 --> 00:03:27,140] | Elapsed: 138.16s | Words: 8  | Text: 人们的事业也会因为
Segment #124 [00:03:27,140 --> 00:03:28,360] | Elapsed: 138.16s | Words: 9  | Text: 稀缺心态而变得狭隘
Segment #125 [00:03:28,760 --> 00:03:29,820] | Elapsed: 138.16s | Words: 6  | Text: 然后就是判断能力
Segment #126 [00:03:29,820 --> 00:03:30,640] | Elapsed: 138.16s | Words: 5  | Text: 和认知问题了
Segment #127 [00:03:30,640 --> 00:03:32,280] | Elapsed: 138.16s | Words: 6  | Text: 和认知能力吧
Segment #128 [00:03:32,280 --> 00:03:32,940] | Elapsed: 138.16s | Words: 4  | Text: 不是认知问题
Segment #129 [00:03:33,660 --> 00:03:35,180] | Elapsed: 138.16s | Words: 8  | Text: 也会过多的去关注
Segment #130 [00:03:35,180 --> 00:03:35,720] | Elapsed: 138.16s | Words: 4  | Text: 眼前的问题
Segment #131 [00:03:35,720 --> 00:03:36,560] | Elapsed: 138.16s | Words: 5  | Text: 去大打折扣
Segment #132 [00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:38,220] | Elapsed: 138.16s | Words: 7  | Text: 他们会大量的时间去
Segment #133 [00:03:38,220 --> 00:03:41,660] | Elapsed: 138.16s | Words: 9  | Text: 把有限的精力去计较
Segment #134 [00:03:41,660 --> 00:03:42,740] | Elapsed: 138.16s | Words: 6  | Text: 哎呀我怎么今天去
Segment #135 [00:03:42,740 --> 00:03:44,440] | Elapsed: 138.16s | Words: 6  | Text: 多省五十块钱
Segment #136 [00:03:45,040 --> 00:03:46,740] | Elapsed: 138.16s | Words: 9  | Text: 我明天多送两台外卖
Segment #137 [00:03:46,740 --> 00:03:47,520] | Elapsed: 138.16s | Words: 5  | Text: 我多挣二十
Segment #138 [00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:49,240] | Elapsed: 138.16s | Words: 8  | Text: 我吃个带肉的盒份
Segment #139 [00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:50,700] | Elapsed: 158.22s | Words: 7  | Text: 而从来不会去考虑
Segment #140 [00:03:50,700 --> 00:03:52,060] | Elapsed: 158.22s | Words: 10 | Text: 考虑长期的投资和发展
Segment #141 [00:03:52,060 --> 00:03:54,000] | Elapsed: 158.22s | Words: 9  | Text: 到最后就是全程毕零了
Segment #142 [00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:55,080] | Elapsed: 158.22s | Words: 5  | Text: 人都喜欢跟自己
Segment #143 [00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:56,380] | Elapsed: 158.22s | Words: 8  | Text: 书瓶相当的人在一起玩
Segment #144 [00:03:56,380 --> 00:03:57,660] | Elapsed: 158.22s | Words: 8  | Text: 老天你一个月挣五千
Segment #145 [00:03:57,660 --> 00:03:58,500] | Elapsed: 158.22s | Words: 4  | Text: 你作为朋友
Segment #146 [00:03:58,500 --> 00:03:59,720] | Elapsed: 158.22s | Words: 7  | Text: 大概率也是同等水平
Segment #147 [00:03:59,720 --> 00:04:01,280] | Elapsed: 158.22s | Words: 7  | Text: 人家聊天聊的是什么
Segment #148 [00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:02,420] | Elapsed: 158.22s | Words: 5  | Text: 有什么好生意
Segment #149 [00:04:02,420 --> 00:04:03,380] | Elapsed: 158.22s | Words: 6  | Text: 大家一起做一做一
Segment #150 [00:04:03,380 --> 00:04:05,360] | Elapsed: 158.22s | Words: 7  | Text: 投资一起找点事做
Segment #151 [00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:06,320] | Elapsed: 158.22s | Words: 6  | Text: 你喝点烂啤酒
Segment #152 [00:04:06,320 --> 00:04:07,400] | Elapsed: 158.22s | Words: 7  | Text: 开始聊上英雄联盟
Segment #153 [00:04:07,400 --> 00:04:08,920] | Elapsed: 158.22s | Words: 10 | Text: 上来恶意打不过瑞文了
Segment #154 [00:04:09,300 --> 00:04:10,400] | Elapsed: 158.22s | Words: 6  | Text: 穷人的圈子里
Segment #155 [00:04:10,880 --> 00:04:11,960] | Elapsed: 158.22s | Words: 6  | Text: 是聊八卦加啥
Segment #156 [00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:13,000] | Elapsed: 158.22s | Words: 6  | Text: 夫人的圈子里
Segment #157 [00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:14,160] | Elapsed: 158.22s | Words: 8  | Text: 是分享的信息和机会
Segment #158 [00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:16,160] | Elapsed: 158.22s | Words: 8  | Text: 那当然一个优秀的圈子
Segment #159 [00:04:16,160 --> 00:04:17,200] | Elapsed: 158.22s | Words: 6  | Text: 它可能不仅仅是
Segment #160 [00:04:17,200 --> 00:04:19,760] | Elapsed: 175.06s | Words: 10 | Text: 资源 学识 见识 认知 眼界
Segment #161 [00:04:20,900 --> 00:04:21,800] | Elapsed: 175.06s | Words: 4  | Text: 不是这么简单
Segment #162 [00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:23,020] | Elapsed: 175.06s | Words: 6  | Text: 有可能情绪价值
Segment #163 [00:04:23,020 --> 00:04:24,600] | Elapsed: 175.06s | Words: 8  | Text: 都要比普通的圈子
Segment #164 [00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:26,480] | Elapsed: 175.06s | Words: 8  | Text: 一般的圈子要多一些
Segment #165 [00:04:26,480 --> 00:04:27,800] | Elapsed: 175.06s | Words: 8  | Text: 这就是为什么有很多的家长
Segment #166 [00:04:27,800 --> 00:04:28,540] | Elapsed: 175.06s | Words: 4  | Text: 我挤破头
Segment #167 [00:04:28,540 --> 00:04:31,020] | Elapsed: 175.06s | Words: 11 | Text: 我也想把我的孩子送给更好的学校
Segment #168 [00:04:31,020 --> 00:04:33,180] | Elapsed: 175.06s | Words: 9  | Text: 让它节省一些有能量的人
Segment #169 [00:04:33,540 --> 00:04:35,040] | Elapsed: 175.06s | Words: 8  | Text: 但是现实上它很残酷
Segment #170 [00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:36,840] | Elapsed: 175.06s | Words: 9  | Text: 那突破阶层它并不容易
Segment #171 [00:04:36,840 --> 00:04:38,220] | Elapsed: 175.06s | Words: 9  | Text: 普通人的核心经验力
Segment #172 [00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:39,740] | Elapsed: 175.06s | Words: 6  | Text: 一般都比较低
Segment #173 [00:04:41,080 --> 00:04:42,360] | Elapsed: 175.06s | Words: 6  | Text: 而且人在没钱的时候
Segment #174 [00:04:42,360 --> 00:04:43,160] | Elapsed: 175.06s | Words: 6  | Text: 在社交过程中
Segment #175 [00:04:43,160 --> 00:04:45,580] | Elapsed: 175.06s | Words: 12 | Text: 会往往体现出很强的功力型
